          THE <br/>
          DA VINCI<br/>

          <span>CODE</span>
        </h1>
        
        
        
        <div class="intro-block">
          <p>
           Eda Eren is a self-taught developer with wide-ranging interests across web technologies and software development. She's come to tech from a humanities background, bringing with her a keen interest in language (both human and programming), how we learn, and how we shape language to communicate our ideas. She believes in technology's potential for good and shares her passion through writing. In her free time, she enjoys nature, surrealist art, and (mostly heavy) music.
          </p>
        </div>

